<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head') %>

</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main id="main-content">

<section class="sh-page-hero" aria-label="FAQ hero">
  <div class="sh-container">
    <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
    <p>Find answers to common questions about our engineering and manufacturing services.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sh-section" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="sh-container sh-container-narrow">
    <div class="sh-section-title"><h2 id="faq-heading">Common Questions</h2></div>

    <div class="sh-faq-item sh-animate">
      <button class="sh-faq-item__question" aria-expanded="false">What industries do you serve?</button>
      <div class="sh-faq-item__answer"><p>We serve Agriculture, Automobile, Medical, Oil & Gas, and Home & Office industries. Our manufacturing capabilities are adaptable to meet the specific requirements of each sector, from precision medical components to heavy-duty oil field equipment.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sh-faq-item sh-animate">
      <button class="sh-faq-item__question" aria-expanded="false">What manufacturing technologies do you use?</button>
      <div class="sh-faq-item__answer"><p>We operate four core technologies: 3D Printing (for prototyping and complex geometries), Laser Cutting (for precision sheet metal and acrylic), CNC Punching (for high-volume standardized components), and Plasma Cutting (for thick steel and aluminum plates). We select the optimal technology based on your material, tolerance, and volume requirements.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sh-faq-item sh-animate">
      <button class="sh-faq-item__question" aria-expanded="false">How do I request a quote?</button>
      <div class="sh-faq-item__answer"><p>You can request a quote through our online form, by email at info@sharehubseng.com, or by calling +234 913 511 6716. Provide as much detail as possible about your project — dimensions, materials, quantity, and intended use — and we will respond within 24 hours with a detailed, no-obligation quote.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sh-faq-item sh-animate">
      <button class="sh-faq-item__question" aria-expanded="false">What is your typical turnaround time?</button>
      <div class="sh-faq-item__answer"><p>Turnaround depends on project complexity and current workload. Simple laser cutting jobs can be completed in 2–3 days. 3D printed prototypes typically take 3–5 days. Larger CNC or plasma cutting projects may require 1–2 weeks. We always provide a realistic timeline with every quote.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sh-faq-item sh-animate">
      <button class="sh-faq-item__question" aria-expanded="false">Do you offer design services?</button>
      <div class="sh-faq-item__answer"><p>Yes. Our engineering consultancy service covers design review, feasibility analysis, material selection, and process optimization. We use SolidWorks, AutoCAD, and ANSYS to create and validate designs before manufacturing. If you have an idea but no technical drawings, we can help develop it into a production-ready design.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sh-faq-item sh-animate">
      <button class="sh-faq-item__question" aria-expanded="false">What file formats do you accept?</button>
      <div class="sh-faq-item__answer"><p>For 3D printing and CNC work, we prefer STEP, STL, or IGES files. For 2D cutting (laser, plasma, punching), DXF or DWG files work best. If you only have a sketch or physical sample, our team can reverse-engineer it into a manufacturable design.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sh-faq-item sh-animate">
      <button class="sh-faq-item__question" aria-expanded="false">Do you work with individuals or only companies?</button>
      <div class="sh-faq-item__answer"><p>We work with both. Whether you are a large industrial company needing batch production, a startup requiring prototypes, or an individual with a custom project, we treat every client with the same level of attention and precision.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sh-faq-item sh-animate">
      <button class="sh-faq-item__question" aria-expanded="false">Where are you located?</button>
      <div class="sh-faq-item__answer"><p>Our headquarters is in Oshodi, Lagos, Nigeria. We serve clients across Lagos State and throughout Nigeria. For large projects, we can arrange on-site consultations and delivery nationwide.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sh-cta">
  <div class="sh-container">
    <h2>Still Have Questions?</h2>
    <p>Our team is happy to answer any specific questions about your project or our capabilities.</p>
    <div class="sh-cta__actions">
      <a href="/contact" class="sh-btn sh-btn--primary sh-btn--lg">Contact Us</a>
      <a href="/request-consultation" class="sh-btn sh-btn--ghost sh-btn--lg">Request a Consultation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
<%- include('partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
